@startuml architecture-deployment
title 图 2-2 系统物理架构部署图\n（开发环境 / Docker Compose 演示环境）

skinparam {
  DefaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
  DefaultFontSize 12
  shadowing false
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  BorderColor #94A3B8
}

actor "用户\nChrome / Edge" as BROWSER

node "开发环境" as DEV #F8FAFC {
  node "开发者电脑" {
    artifact "Vite 开发服务器\n:5173" as VITE
    artifact "Spring Boot\n:8080" as DEV_APP
    database "MySQL 8.0\n:3306" as DEV_DB
  }
}

node "Docker Compose 主机（演示 / 验收环境）" as HOST #F5F3FF {
  node "nginx 容器" as NGINX {
    artifact "Vue dist\n静态资源" as DIST
    artifact "/api 反向代理" as PROXY
  }
  node "backend 容器" as BACKEND {
    component "Spring Boot 3.5\nJWT / 权限 / 状态机 / 审计" as APP
  }
  database "mysql 容器\nMySQL 8.0 :3306" as MYSQL
  database "redis 容器（可选）\n:6379" as REDIS
  node "数据卷" as VOL {
    artifact "mysql-data" as VOL_DB
    artifact "uploads\n问诊图片" as VOL_FS
  }
}

cloud "外部系统（本期不接入）" as EXT {
  [真实支付通道] as PAY
  [医保结算] as INSURANCE
}

BROWSER --> DIST : HTTP/HTTPS :80/443
BROWSER --> VITE : 开发访问 :5173
VITE --> DEV_APP : /api 代理
DEV_APP --> DEV_DB : JDBC :3306
DIST --> PROXY
PROXY --> APP : :8080
APP --> MYSQL : JDBC :3306
APP --> REDIS : 可选
MYSQL --> VOL_DB : 数据文件
APP --> VOL_FS : 上传文件
APP ..> PAY : 本期不接入
APP ..> INSURANCE : 本期不接入

note bottom of MYSQL
  演示环境 MySQL / Redis 不映射到宿主机端口，
  只加入 Docker 内部网络；
  对外仅开放 Nginx 的 80/443。
end note

note bottom of APP
  JWT_SECRET、DB 密码由 .env 注入，不提交到 Git；
  后端无状态，可在 Nginx 后水平扩展多个实例。
end note

note bottom of DEV
  开发环境不启 Nginx：
  Vite 将 /api 代理到 localhost:8080，
  避免 CORS；前端与后端可分别启动。
end note

@enduml
